VOSIM (working name), a machine of model27 (tools/machines/vosim/): Mutable Instruments Braids' VOSIM oscillator by
Emilie Gillet (https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack, commit 08460a6), carried over integer for integer in C:
DigitalOscillator::RenderVosim and ComputePhaseIncrement (braids/digital_oscillator.cc) and stmlib's Interpolate824
(stmlib/utils/dsp.h, commit e3bd7c9). Braids' tables lut_bell, wav_sine and lut_oscillator_increments
(braids/resources.cc) are copied as they are into tools/machines/vosim/vosim_tables.h by tools/gen_vosim.py. The
formant tracking, the window family and its level and the DC stage are model27's.
